 151:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  that the endpoint should have one single bank, which requires less USB FIFO memory but resul
 152:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  in slower transfers as only one USB device (the AVR or the host) can access the endpoint's
 153:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  bank at the one time.
