 175:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			/** Detaches the device from the USB bus. This has the effect of removing the device from any
 176:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			 *  attached host, ceasing USB communications. If no host is present, this prevents any host fro
